. then pocketbook of the Duke's clerk. Always comes up for a smoke at midnight; get in and out after.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> is not rescued in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Furbleston\" title=\"Furbleston\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Furbleston.png/25px-Portrait_Furbleston.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Furbleston.png/38px-Portrait_Furbleston.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Furbleston.png/50px-Portrait_Furbleston.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Furbleston\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Furbleston.png/25px-Portrait_Furbleston.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Portrait_Furbleston.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></s